# v2fly/domain-list-community's own curated "cn" category (banks, media,
# dev tools, e-commerce, ~158 sub-lists) instead of a raw dnsmasq-china-list
# dump -- resolves to ~8.7k domain rules vs. ~111k for the raw list, a
# meaningful difference on memory-constrained mobile clients (Happ).
# Freshness comes from the v2fly builder checkout in the workflow (already
# cloned fresh on every build) tracking upstream's own maintenance, not from
# a locally-committed copy that can drift.
include:cn
